# Power splits as kappa and 1 - kappa, and nothing is lost or reflected.

title Directional coupler, 10% cross coupling
medium lambda0=1.55 neff=2.4 ng=4.2 loss_db_cm=0
sweep 1.5 1.6 21

comp c coupler kappa=0.1
port in c.1
port isolated c.2
port bar c.3
port cross c.4

expect lossless
expect reciprocal
expect level cross 1.55 -10.00000000 1e-6
expect level bar 1.55 -0.45757491 1e-6
expect below isolated -200
